public static class ExpiryAndTraceCases{public static int Run(){var failures=new List<string>();foreach(string k in new[]{"lateExpiry","infiniteNormal"}){try{var e=new Fixture();var r=e.Drop();e.Below();if(k=="lateExpiry")Hooks.Once("world/trace",()=>Runtime.Now=r.m_iCreatedAt+10000);else Runtime.Game.World.Normal=new Vec(0,float.PositiveInfinity,0);e.Tick();if(Runtime.DeleteRequests.Count!=0)failures.Add(k+": delete requested from expired/unknown permission");}catch(Exception x){failures.Add(k+": "+x.Message);}}if(failures.Count>0)throw new Exception(string.Join("; ",failures));return 2;}}
'@
# Enforce's finite check uses x != x for NaN; preserve that IEEE expression.
$code="#pragma warning disable 1718`r`n"+'namespace DroppedWeaponSafetyReplay{'+$shim+(Replay $source)+$cases+'}'
Add-Type -TypeDefinition $code -Language CSharp
$count=[DroppedWeaponSafetyReplay.Cases]::Run()
$count+=[DroppedWeaponSafetyReplay.ExpiryAndTraceCases]::Run()
$unsafe=@(
 @('terrainProof','if (!CrossedTerrain(record)) return;',''),
 @('rootAddedRevoke','safety.Invalidate(item);',''),
 @('humanVeto','!HumansClear(record)','false'),
 @('subtree','!SubtreeSafe(record)','false'),
 @('confirmRpl','entityAbsent && rplAbsent','entityAbsent'),
 @('finiteTraceNormal','if (!FinitePoint(trace.TraceNorm)) return false;',''),
 @('freshTTL','if (age < 0 || age >= TTL_MS) { record.m_bCancelled = true; return; }',''),
 @('physicalContext','PhysicalContext(record)','Context(record)'),
 @('finalFree','if (!SubtreeSafe(record) || !ItemFree(record) || !Authority(record.m_iEpoch)) return;','if (!SubtreeSafe(record) || !Authority(record.m_iEpoch)) return;')
)
$caught=0
foreach($m in $unsafe){if(!$code.Contains($m[1])){throw "Missing source-bound safety unsafe: $($m[0])"};$ns='DroppedWeaponSafetyUnsafe'+$m[0];$variant=$code.Replace('DroppedWeaponSafetyReplay',$ns).Replace($m[1],$m[2]);Add-Type -TypeDefinition $variant -Language CSharp;$rejected=$false;try{[void]([type]($ns+'.Cases')).GetMethod('Run').Invoke($null,@());[void]([type]($ns+'.ExpiryAndTraceCases')).GetMethod('Run').Invoke($null,@())}catch{$rejected=$true};if(!$rejected){throw "Safety unsafe escaped: $($m[0])"};$caught++}
if((Get-FileHash $sourcePath -Algorithm SHA256).Hash-cne$sourceSha){throw 'Production source changed while replay running'}
"PASS dropped_weapon_fall_safety actual_source_cases=$count executable_unsafe=$caught source_sha256=$sourceSha native_apis=SIMULATED Workbench=NOT_RUN physical_runtime=NOT_RUN"
